<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2109940726"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1721997128"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="永遠という光"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="fhána"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Beautiful Dreamer"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:12.479"><div begin="00:15.080" end="05:02.177"><p begin="00:15.080" end="00:19.332" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">バカだねって戯れ合って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真是傻瓜呢 如此相互打趣着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ba ka da ne 't te ja re a 't te</span></p><p begin="00:20.081" end="00:23.262" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">帰り道歩く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走在回家的路上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka e ri mi chi a ru ku</span></p><p begin="00:23.423" end="00:28.274" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">いつでもそこにあるはずだと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾相信那样的景色</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu de mo so ko ni a ru ha zu da to</span></p><p begin="00:28.415" end="00:32.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">信じていた景色<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会永远停留在原地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ji te i ta ke shi ki</span></p><p begin="00:32.875" end="00:36.547" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">昨日に似た今日という日<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与昨日相似的今日</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki no u ni ni ta kyo u to i u hi</span></p><p begin="00:36.738" end="00:40.962" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">また繰り返していく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍将不断重复下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta ku ri ka e shi te i ku</span></p><p begin="00:41.129" end="00:45.902" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">そんな揺るぎのない暮らしが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾以为那样不可动摇的生活</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na yu ru gi no na i ku ra shi ga</span></p><p begin="00:46.218" end="00:50.267" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">続く気がしてた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会一直延续下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu du ku ki ga shi te ta</span></p><p begin="00:51.192" end="00:55.086" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">雨上がりの冬の陽に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在雨过天晴的冬日暖阳里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a me a ga ri no fu yu no yo u ni</span></p><p begin="00:55.678" end="00:59.745" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">僕ら手を取り合って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们牵起彼此的手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra te wo to ri a 't te</span></p><p begin="01:00.033" end="01:03.784" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">冷たい息を吸った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深吸了一口冷空气</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu me ta i i ki wo su 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:03.995" end="01:09.646" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">こぼしてしまわないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">克制着不让眼泪落下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko bo shi te shi ma wa na i de</span></p><p begin="01:09.758" end="01:13.879" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">世界が君をどこかへ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i ga ki mi wo do ko ka he</span></p><p begin="01:13.959" end="01:19.224" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">隠してしまって見つけられなくても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将你藏在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ku shi te shi ma 't te</span></p><p begin="01:19.224" end="01:23.803" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">今 僕だけの鍵が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在 只属于我的钥匙</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma bo ku da ke no ka gi ga</span></p><p begin="01:23.994" end="01:26.491" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">扉を開く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也会将那扇门打开</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to bi ra wo hi ra ku</span></p><p begin="01:26.491" end="01:31.643" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">ああ 忘れてしまうことなんて嫌だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想要把你忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a</span></p><p begin="01:31.743" end="01:34.815" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">強く想えるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份期盼是如此的强烈</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yo ku o mo e ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:34.815" end="01:39.362" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">きっと 呼び覚ますよ さあ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定会让记忆苏醒过来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to yo bi sa ma su yo sa a</span></p><p begin="01:39.503" end="01:46.461" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">糸を手繰り 君のもとに帰ろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我顺着那根线回到你的身边吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i to wo ta gu ri ki mi no mo to ni ka e ro u</span></p><p begin="01:59.525" end="02:03.551" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">振り向いたその笑顔に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看着你回头时的笑容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri mu i ta so no e ga o ni</span></p><p begin="02:04.482" end="02:07.614" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">またねと呟く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我小声地说了声再见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta ne to tsu bu ya ku</span></p><p begin="02:07.915" end="02:12.632" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">たとえ明日がもう来ないと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕早已明白</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e a shi ta ga mo u ko na i to</span></p><p begin="02:12.863" end="02:16.698" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">わかっていたとしても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明天不会再来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ka 't te i ta to shi te mo</span></p><p begin="02:17.775" end="02:21.835" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">そんな想像をするほど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还是会不禁想象</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na so u zo u wo su ru ho do</span></p><p begin="02:22.235" end="02:26.378" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">遠ざかっていく君を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你渐渐离我远去的那一幕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to o za ka 't te i ku ki mi wo</span></p><p begin="02:26.753" end="02:30.456" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">この世界にどうして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要怎么做</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no se ka i ni do u shi te</span></p><p begin="02:30.636" end="02:36.168" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">つなぎ止められるの？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才能把你留在这个世界呢?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu na gi to me ra re ru no ?</span></p><p begin="02:36.495" end="02:40.498" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">いつでも信じていたよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾一直相信</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu de mo shi n ji te i ta yo</span></p><p begin="02:40.658" end="02:45.903" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">神様くらいに僕を救ってしまう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">神会将我救赎</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka mi sa ma ku ra i ni bo ku wo su ku 't te shi ma u</span></p><p begin="02:45.903" end="02:50.473" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">きっと永遠なんて嘘？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所谓的永恒一定是谎言吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to e i e n na n te u so ?</span></p><p begin="02:50.633" end="02:55.362" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">だけど一番輝いていたさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却绽放着最为耀眼的光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ke do i chi ba n ka ga ya i te i ta sa</span></p><p begin="02:55.362" end="03:05.578" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">僕らは境界を彷徨い続け ここから(ずっと)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们仍会继续徘徊于边界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra ha kyo u ka i wo sa ma yo i tsu du ke</span></p><p begin="03:04.299" end="03:13.255" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">何度もその名前を叫んだ (Call your name)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无数次呼唤你的名字 (呼唤你的名字)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n do mo so no na ma e wo sa ke n da ( call your name)</span></p><p begin="03:34.199" end="03:38.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">世界が君をどこかへ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i ga ki mi wo do ko ka he</span></p><p begin="03:38.420" end="03:43.699" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">隠してしまって見つけられなくても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将你藏在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ku shi te shi ma 't te</span></p><p begin="03:43.699" end="03:48.261" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">ただ僕だけの光が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只属于我的光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da bo ku da ke no hi ka ri ga</span></p><p begin="03:48.410" end="03:50.941" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">扉を開くよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也会推开那扇门</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to bi ra wo hi ra ku yo</span></p><p begin="03:50.941" end="03:53.852" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">ああ信じていたよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 我曾相信</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a shi n ji te i ta yo</span></p><p begin="03:53.992" end="03:59.241" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">神様くらいに僕を救ってしまう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">神会将我救赎</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka mi sa ma ku ra i ni bo ku wo su ku 't te shi ma u</span></p><p begin="03:59.241" end="04:03.811" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">きっと永遠なんて嘘？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所谓的永恒一定是谎言吗?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to e i e n na n te u so ?</span></p><p begin="04:03.949" end="04:06.483" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">だけど愛しいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但却如此惹人喜欢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ke do i to shi i yo</span></p><p begin="04:06.483" end="04:11.638" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">ああ忘れてしまう 絶対に嫌だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 我绝对不要把你忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a wa su re te shi ma u ze 't ta i ni i ya da</span></p><p begin="04:11.740" end="04:14.847" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">強く想えるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份期盼是如此的强烈</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yo ku o mo e ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="04:14.847" end="04:19.356" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">あの輝く季節へと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次回到记忆中闪闪发光的季节</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ka ga ya ku ki se tsu he to</span></p><p begin="04:19.527" end="04:26.553" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">糸を手繰り君のもとに帰ろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我顺着那根线回到你的身边吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i to wo ta gu ri ki mi no mo to ni ka e ro u</span></p><p begin="04:27.049" end="04:40.019" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">あの日僕を救った (永遠という)光<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那一天拯救了我的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no hi bo ku wo su ku 't ta</span></p><p begin="04:40.357" end="04:50.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">やっと時が来たんだ (言わなくちゃ)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一刻终于来到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya 't to to ki ga ki ta n da</span></p><p begin="04:50.362" end="05:02.177" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">さよなら またどこかで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们一定还会在某处重逢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa yo na ra ma ta do ko ka de</span></p></div></body></tt>